                                </button>
                                <button class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-[#f0f3f4] dark:bg-[#2a3a46] text-[#617989] font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-primary/5 transition-all">
                                    <span>6-8 Years</span>
