                            <img class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" alt="Cover of an educational book about the solar system planets" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDym2z-iGs0ozrdgfPZEWKkRMZxNU41iMLu8-5GmnWj-hSE4RCNlGea1acTKHsfmvHTV9qcTRuaUFbWgLdp7N5SgwLZQtv0be7Knv2YkxbUZ5SaN_TAV92MsmuwdfumQIBnisyal8ZWClR4YK_UGty5m_iFZ8HKWZYge2ntCzj2gIwgSQVMBVY5SeTNIVM28TetlPmZ60R-o4C-Awkk2RG97bytsyxJfNZtuzoln8wHXumwXyVyG7UwbO9NqZnI_wP7sucfWVqisBE"/>
